OL,3,GNEWSADecision made over future of May
OL,4,Afairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo historic Herefordshire fairs will
OL,7,Fremain in their traditional locations
OL,8,Fafter a public consultation.
OL,10,FHerefordshire Council said 1,366 people
OL,11,Fresponded to a review of the future of
OL,12,FHereford and Leominster May fairs, with
OL,13,Fthe findings set to shape plans for the
OL,14,Fevents from 2028.
OL,16,FIn Hereford, 71% of respondents backed
OL,17,Fthe fair remaining in the city centre,
OL,18,Fwhile 55% in Leominster supported it
OL,19,Fcontinuing in its current location.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
