OL,3,GNEWSADecision made over future of May
OL,4,Afairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Hereford May Fair dates back to a
OL,7,FRoyal Charter granted in 1121 by Henry
OL,8,FI and is widely believed to be
OL,9,FBritain's oldest surviving charter
OL,10,Ffair.
